															<div class="game_description_snippet">
									Build an alien homestead in a cosy creature-collecting farming RPG. Tame 300 companions to fight in turn-based battles and work your ranch. Grow crops, harpoon fish to feed your team, decorate your cottage, and brave the mines with sword combat. Play solo or with friends—100% free to play!								</div>
