								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >A ranch full of creatures. A world full of more to catch.</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Turn a patch of alien soil into a thriving ranch, fill it with creatures you've met on your travels, and set out again to find the next one. Starbloom Ranch brings cosy farming, creature collecting and turn-based battles together, with a home worth coming back to after every adventure.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Grow a ranch full of life</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Plant, water and harvest colourful crops through spring, summer, autumn and winter. Each season changes the land and brings its own festival: the Blossom Fair, the Starlight Parade, the Harvest Moon Fair and the Frostlight Gathering. Sell your harvest, expand your gardens and make room for new residents. Your creatures roam the ranch, and as friendships grow they help with watering, gardening, foraging and the nursery.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/8b71a7fe8c5972fb45b877661b3b7b09.poster.avif?t=1793138399" width=400 height=224 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/8b71a7fe8c5972fb45b877661b3b7b09.webm?t=1793138399" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/8b71a7fe8c5972fb45b877661b3b7b09.mp4?t=1793138399" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Catch all 300 creatures</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Discover 300 species across meadows, coasts, reefs, caves and five Frontier destinations, from Sunpetal Coast to Astral Reach. Scan wild creatures to learn their capture conditions, weaken them in battle and throw a Capture Prism to bring them home. Raise your favourites until they evolve, and fill every page of your Xenodex.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/9dbb45cd66b176dac3f38341fc716ea9.poster.avif?t=1793138399" width=520 height=292 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/9dbb45cd66b176dac3f38341fc716ea9.webm?t=1793138399" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/9dbb45cd66b176dac3f38341fc716ea9.mp4?t=1793138399" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Battle eight Wardens and the Grand League</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Build a team around elemental strengths, manage energy and choose your moves in turn-based battles. Challenge the eight Wardens in their own painted arenas to earn every badge, then take on the Grand League: four Elites and a Champion you know all too well.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/56cdf88c6422c7d06645188acdf35ad0.poster.avif?t=1793138399" width=440 height=248 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/56cdf88c6422c7d06645188acdf35ad0.webm?t=1793138399" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/56cdf88c6422c7d06645188acdf35ad0.mp4?t=1793138399" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Build the ranch of your dreams</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Open the ranch build menu and choose from more than 80 pieces: paths and fences, gardens and trees, festival decorations, farm buildings and cosy creature homes. Place, rotate and rearrange them however you like, then furnish your cottage to match.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/5e611fb86ed10f5cbb0ed7ab1b4d0f96.poster.avif?t=1793138399" width=480 height=270 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/5e611fb86ed10f5cbb0ed7ab1b4d0f96.webm?t=1793138399" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/5e611fb86ed10f5cbb0ed7ab1b4d0f96.mp4?t=1793138399" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Explore, fish, dive and mine</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Leave the garden behind. Charge harpoon shots at swimming fish, ride an aquatic companion across the lagoon, dive through coral reefs, and break ore with upgraded tools in glowing caves, where every side mine hides a guardian and a hidden cache. Chain sword attacks and dashes in real-time field combat, and bring your companion along to help.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/c0b2c290a2d8b715e48fe9d5bf4877a1.poster.avif?t=1793138399" width=400 height=224 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/c0b2c290a2d8b715e48fe9d5bf4877a1.webm?t=1793138399" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5237770/extras/c0b2c290a2d8b715e48fe9d5bf4877a1.mp4?t=1793138399" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Play together</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Play online co-op with friends: up to 4 ranchers, or up to 8 in an experimental mode. Invite friends from Steam or share a short ranch code with them. Farm one ranch together, fish the pond, team up in battles and duel each other, then head home to your own cottage.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Play your way</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Full controller support and Steam Deck-friendly text. Unwatered crops wait safely instead of dying, and friendships never decay.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
